    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d473">

                <pb facs="0577" n="509" sameAs="frus:frus1914-20v01/pg509"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">865.857 An 2/95: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Austria-Hungary</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Penfield</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Vienna</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-12-29T17:00:00+01:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 29, 1915—5 p. m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [Received December 30—2:45 p. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1063. Austro-Hungarian answer<anchor n="83" xml:id="d473-f1"/> to second <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Ancona</hi> note<anchor n="84" xml:id="d473-f2"/>
                    received at 4:30 this afternoon. It is communication upwards of 3,000 words.
                    Will require all night to translate and encipher.</p>
                <p>Note is practical compliance with our demands. It acknowledges culpability of
                    submarine commander who it states has been punished. Will pay indemnities under
                    certain conditions, but specifically leaves <pb facs="0578" n="510"
                        xml:id="pg510"/> question of future conduct of submarine warfare for further
                    discussion. Reciprocal desire for maintenance of good relations is
                    expressed.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Penfield</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
